.git
.gitignore
.venv
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
.env*
!.env*.example
frontend
docs
scripts
policies
.worktrees
.agents
.claude
backend/tests
mcp_financial_action_server/tests
